# Binary assets are committed directly — Git LFS is intentionally NOT
# enabled. The placeholder assets are small (a few MB total), and LFS filter
# rules break checkout for anyone without git-lfs installed. When large
# final assets arrive (USDZ models, long-form audio), enable LFS then:
# `git lfs install && git lfs track '*.usdz'` and migrate.
*.wav binary
*.caf binary
*.aif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.usdz binary
*.usdc binary
*.blend binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
